performance[loop-order]: innermost loop over `col` walks index 2 of `grid`
 --> positive.jl:5:13
  |
4 |         for col in axes(grid, 2)
  |             -------------------- innermost loop
5 |             grid[row, col] = row + col
  |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ strided access
  |
  = why: arrays store first index contiguously; inner loop should run over first index
  = confidence: possible
  = fix: swap loops so `row` varies fastest   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain loop-order

